SUMMARY:Restorative Reiki Sound Healing with Genevieve Deely
DESCRIPTION:Join Reiki Master and Sound Healing Practitioner Genevieve Deely for a deeply restorative Sound Bath on Thursday\, July 23\, from 7:00–8:30 PM. \nGenevieve creates nurturing spaces that blend sound healing\, energy work\, and spiritual exploration. Through the soothing vibrations of crystal singing bowls and other sacred instruments\, you’ll be invited to relax\, reconnect\, and journey inward. \nHeld in a beautiful space devoted to healing\, curiosity\, and expanded awareness\, this evening is open to anyone seeking greater peace\, clarity\, and connection. \nPlease bring a yoga mat\, pillow\, and blanket for your comfort. \nGenevieve Deely \nhttp://www.channelofyourpeace.com \nInstagram: @ChannelofyourpeaceNJ
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/restorative-reiki-sound-healing-with-genevieve-deely/
CATEGORIES:Meditation,The Space for Wellness,Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/52-e1782319824178.jpeg
END:VEVENT
