SUMMARY:Tantra for Modern-day Couples: Practical Tools for Lasting Intimacy - 2 day workshop
DESCRIPTION:Couples\, it is time to move beyond the routine and into a deeper presence and connection. \nIn our modern\, fast-paced world\, we often “chase” intimacy rather than cultivating it. We look for quick fixes for a connection that requires deep roots. Tantra for the Modern Couple is a transformative 2-day immersion designed to bring ancient\, time-tested wisdom into your contemporary relationship. \nTantra is not just an old concept; it is a profound map for connection that has lasted centuries because it works. We’ve translated these traditional secrets into simple\, learnable practices that fit into your busy life—helping you move from “staying strong” to “expanding together.”  \nThis is for you if.. \n\nYou want quality time in a low-pressure\, grounded environment.\n\n\nYou are curious about Tantra but want a practical\, couple-friendly approach.\n\n\nYou crave a deeper connection and are ready to try a fresh\, “seasonal” reset for your relationship.\n\nDATE: Saturday & Sunday\, July 25and 26. \nTIME: Saturday 10:00 – 5:00. Sunday 10:00 – 4:00 (1 hour lunch on your own each day\, light refreshments and snacks provided during breaks) \nCOST: $697 (Early bird before July 4th $597) \nREGISTER HERE!! \nLOCATION: The Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, NJ 07042 (Use the door labeled ‘356’ between ‘Hey Yogurt’ and “A&M Barber Shop” and go upstairs. Please allow plenty of time for parking.) Parking is available around the corner on S. Willow Street. \nFIRST TIMERS: Please schedule a brief phone call with Olga before ordering tickets. TEXT 862-251-2444 to arrange your call.  \nBONUS: FREE Couples Zoom Coaching Call with me. Schedule it after the event to help you integrate what you learned\, troubleshoot what gets in the way\, and keep your relationship moving forward together. \nLIMITED SPACE: To keep the experience intimate\, we limit the number of couples. These events fill quickly—save your spot early. \nWHAT TO BRING: Wear comfortable clothing you can move around in. Bring one yoga mat per couple (some provided)\, blanket\, water bottle\, pillows or back jacks to sit on. Seating will be on the floor. Chairs are also available. \nYOUR WEEKEND JOURNEY \nOver two days\, you will step out of the digital noise and into a sanctuary of presence. You will leave with a “Relationship Toolbox”—a collection of ancient rituals and modern communication tools to keep your love tended\, alive\, and flourishing. \nWhat to Expect \n\nA Sacred\, Supportive Space: A warm\, cozy environment where you can explore without pressure or awkwardness.\n\n\nMeaningful Communication: Exercises to help you listen with your heart and express yourself with clarity.\n\n\nPractical Rituals: Simple\, guided practices involving meditation and touch that you can take home and use immediately.\n\nWHAT PARTICIPANTS ARE SAYING: \n-I would definitely advise anyone who wants to dive deeper to give yourself the gift of this experience. Serena \n-I felt a connection with my spouse I’ve never been able to express with her before. Mike \n-I felt my feelings. I felt truly loved by my spouse. Terry \n-The gentleness of your guidance allowed me to trust in myself and my feelings. Beth \n-I learned simple tools to use in our day-to-day practice. You will leave with more than you came with. Do it!! Venera \n-The pace was excellent. I appreciated the mix of teaching and practice. This was a great experience\, even for the non-spiritual sceptic. It will open your heart and mind in beautiful ways. Bob \n-Take it to help increase openness and communication through shared love and beautiful experiences. Mark \n-Try it! Great practical tools and rituals. There is so much to learn and grow in as a couple. Made me very excited to learn more! Debbie \n-Creating slow time to connect with your partner with guided exercises is so special. Jamie \n-Olga and Bob offer great information\, a loving and safe environment\, and a playful place for couples to find themselves again. Thank you! Maddi \n-It was a great introduction to tantra and developing daily practices to increase and grow intimacy with your partner. Bobby \n-Personal improvement on your relationship\, on how to love better because we aren’t taught how to do so in the first place. JP \n-It’s important to step out of your comfort zone and try something new. This class helps achieve that as well as deeper connectivity and playfulness with your partner. Thank you! Stephanie \n-Great way to be closer to your partner\, great way to get unstuck. It’s just fun! Jim \n-Olga and Bob lead a fantastic workshop for couples to deepen their love and connection and left us with tools to take home and use to continue deeper love. Michael \nYOUR PRESENTERS \nOlga Ribble is a Certified Skydancing Tantra Presenter and Intimacy Coach. With extensive training from world-renowned teachers\, she guides couples to develop better communication and intimacy skills\, leading to fulfilling emotional\, physical\, and spiritual partnerships. https://nordicgoddesstantra.com/ \nBob ‘Cool Dude’ Brown a lifelong teacher and student\, spent over a decade delving into the transformative world of Tantra. Through Tantra\, Bob discovered practices that enhance masculine potency\, foster deeper intimacy and pleasure\, offering a holistic approach that enriches personal and relational experiences. He assists his partner Olga in teaching couples and men’s programs.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/tantra-for-modern-day-couples-practical-tools-for-lasting-intimacy-2-day-workshop/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-05-at-8.58.55-PM.png
END:VEVENT
