UID:9653-1785526200-1785531600@thespaceforart.com
SUMMARY:The Space for Words - Open Mic Night for Writers
DESCRIPTION:The Space for Words – literary open-mic night hosted by the NJ Poetry Circle\nJuly 31  |  Doors open at 7:30\, start time 8 pm  |  $10 for everyone \nThis is a monthly event on the last Friday of every month\, holidays permitting. \nHey writers\, poets\, and storytellers!  Come share your art with us at The Space for Words Open Mic Night. Whether you’re a seasoned author or just getting started\, this is your chance to share your work in front of a supportive and inspiring audience. \nBring your poetry\, short stories\, or excerpts from your latest work — the stage is yours! The Space is a safe place to try out new material\, read old favorites\, experiment with a different genre\, and even to sing a song if inspiration strikes you. Each performer will have a few minutes to showcase their writing\, followed by an opportunity to connect with fellow creatives. \nCome for the words\, stay for the community. The Space for Words has grown into an amazing community of writers supporting one another. This event is open to all levels and all genres\, so whether you write fiction\, non-fiction\, memoir\, or poetry\, we want to hear from you. It’s all about celebrating the power of storytelling in a relaxed\, welcoming atmosphere. All of our open mic nights are always inclusive. \nAnyone who puts their name in the bucket upon entry gets a shot at the mic. You may be limited to about 10 minutes\, depending on how many people sign up. Audience members are\, as always\, a welcome and vital part of the performances. \nIf you have published books that you would like to sell\, bring some copies and be prepared to accept payment. \nGeneral guidelines: \n\nHate speech of any kind is never allowed and will be shut down.\nViolence or references to physical harm to others will be shut down.\n\nBYOB is welcome\, and some light snacks and drinks are served. \nAccessibility: The Space is located on the second floor of a historic building\, accessible via a flight of stairs. Unfortunately\, there is no elevator access at this time. This means we are unable to accommodate wheelchairs or guests with significant mobility challenges. We sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this may cause.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/the-space-for-words-open-mic-night-for-writers-14/
CATEGORIES:The Space for Words
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/open-night-mic.png
END:VEVENT
